---
// src/components/Footer.astro
---

<footer id="footer" class="footer-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-content">
      <h2 class="footer-title">🤝 參與公民科技，一起動手做</h2>
      <p class="footer-subtitle">我們的工作文件完全公開，隨時歡迎你的加入與反饋！</p>
      
      <div class="links-grid">
        <a href="https://g0v.hackmd.io/@jothon/civictech_doc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-card">
          <div class="card-icon">📂</div>
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>工作文件</h3>
            <p>瀏覽共筆、會議記錄與專案規劃文件</p>
          </div>
          <div class="arrow">➔</div>
        </a>

        <a href="https://jothon.g0v.tw/about/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-card">
          <div class="card-icon">💬</div>
          <div class="card-text">
            <h3>聯繫我們</h3>
            <p>瞭解 jothon 團隊或直接與我們聯絡</p>
          </div>
          <div class="arrow">➔</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 台灣公民科技資料庫 Civic Tech Taiwan</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 100%);
    color: #f8fafc;
    padding: 80px 20px 40px;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-content {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .footer-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #38bdf8, #818cf8);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .footer-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .links-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .links-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .link-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .link-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9);
    border-color: #38bdf8;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-right: 20px;
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .link-card:hover .card-icon {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .card-text {
    flex-grow: 1;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .card-text h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .card-text p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .arrow {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #64748b;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    margin-left: 12px;
  }

  .link-card:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    color: #38bdf8;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding-top: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }
</style>
